 ("Vegan Banana Bread", "American", 15, 55, 10, "3|bananas, very ripe, mashed; 80 ml|vegetable oil; 120 g|brown sugar; 80 ml|almond milk; 1 tsp|vanilla extract; 250 g|flour; 1 tsp|baking soda; 1 tsp|cinnamon; 0.5 tsp|salt; 60 g|walnuts, chopped", "Heat the oven to 175 °C (350 °F) and line a loaf tin / Whisk the bananas, oil, sugar, milk and vanilla / Fold in the flour, soda, cinnamon, salt and walnuts / Bake 50 to 55 minutes until a skewer comes out clean"),
